WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.960 --> 00:00:16.604
The pirates did not seem so scary anymore.

2
00:00:17.525 --> 00:00:19.985
Some of them started to swim back to the island.

3
00:00:20.725 --> 00:00:22.506
Others tried to get on their ship.

4
00:00:23.346 --> 00:00:26.047
But of course the animals would not let them.

5
00:00:27.708 --> 00:00:29.088
Then things got worse.

6
00:00:29.756 --> 00:00:33.097
Dr. Dolittle could see sharks swimming toward the pirates.

7
00:00:33.838 --> 00:00:35.178
The pirates saw them too.

8
00:00:35.198 --> 00:00:38.300
"SHARKS! SHARKS!"

9
00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:39.900
they screamed.

10
00:00:40.561 --> 00:00:44.962
Ben Ali, the Barbary Dragon, looked more like the Barbary Frog!

11
00:00:46.543 --> 00:00:49.444
The sharks quickly made a circle around the pirates.

12
00:00:50.485 --> 00:00:52.866
One great shark swam over to Dr.

13
00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:55.067
Dolittle. "Are you Dr.

14
00:00:55.107 --> 00:00:57.208
Dolittle?" the shark asked.

15
00:00:57.228 --> 00:00:59.645
"Yes," the doctor replied.

16
00:00:59.665 --> 00:01:04.648
"Oh, I'm so pleased to meet you," the shark said blushing.

17
00:01:05.869 --> 00:01:07.490
The pirates watched the doctor.

18
00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:08.871
"What is he doing?"

19
00:01:09.312 --> 00:01:10.432
panted one pirate.

20
00:01:10.452 --> 00:01:12.854
"It looks like he's talking to the shark!"

21
00:01:13.454 --> 00:01:14.235
answered another.

22
00:01:14.255 --> 00:01:15.916
"That's impossible!"

23
00:01:16.456 --> 00:01:17.857
the first pirate gasped.

24
00:01:19.719 --> 00:01:21.060
"These men are bad.

25
00:01:21.420 --> 00:01:24.182
Especially Ben Ali," said the shark.

26
00:01:24.202 --> 00:01:27.244
"If you want we will eat them up for you."

27
00:01:28.160 --> 00:01:28.720
"Thank you.

28
00:01:28.981 --> 00:01:30.842
But that's okay," Dr.

29
00:01:30.882 --> 00:01:31.842
Dolittle replied.

30
00:01:31.862 --> 00:01:35.285
"Could you bring Ben Ali over here, please?"

31
00:01:37.266 --> 00:01:39.367
The shark swam over to Ben Ali.

32
00:01:39.387 --> 00:01:41.168
"No! Go away!

33
00:01:41.809 --> 00:01:45.331
Mommy!" cried the Barbary Dragon.

34
00:01:46.071 --> 00:01:48.473
The shark chased Ben Ali over to Dr.

35
00:01:48.513 --> 00:01:50.354
Dolittle. Dr.

36
00:01:50.374 --> 00:01:53.376
Dolittle leaned over the side and spoke to the pirate.

37
00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:55.680
"Ben Ali!

38
00:01:56.001 --> 00:01:58.782
You have been a very bad man!"

39
00:01:59.202 --> 00:02:00.322
scolded the doctor.

40
00:02:00.342 --> 00:02:04.944
"But if you promise to do as I tell you, these sharks will not eat you."

41
00:02:05.865 --> 00:02:09.226
Of course the pirate did not want to become the sharks' dinner.

42
00:02:09.246 --> 00:02:11.767
"What is it?

43
00:02:12.147 --> 00:02:12.787
I promise!"

44
00:02:13.308 --> 00:02:14.648
begged the pirate captain.

45
00:02:16.549 --> 00:02:18.730
Dr. Dolittle pointed to the island.

46
00:02:18.750 --> 00:02:22.031
"You and your men must go to that island."

47
00:02:22.991 --> 00:02:24.072
"And do what?

48
00:02:24.544 --> 00:02:26.085
There's nothing to do there!"

49
00:02:26.605 --> 00:02:27.725
complained Ben Ali.

50
00:02:27.745 --> 00:02:31.927
"You will become farmers," the doctor told him.

51
00:02:31.947 --> 00:02:33.788
"Thunder and lightning!

52
00:02:34.108 --> 00:02:35.889
Never! I am a pirate!"

53
00:02:36.409 --> 00:02:37.510
shouted Ben Ali.

54
00:02:42.332 --> 00:02:44.553
let me be a pirate," he begged.

55
00:02:45.313 --> 00:02:45.953
But Dr.

56
00:02:45.993 --> 00:02:48.034
Dolittle said firmly, "No!

57
00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:52.116
You must promise to be a farmer and never leave the island.

58
00:02:53.220 --> 00:02:58.885
If you don't keep your promise," he warned, "these sharks will eat you up."

59
00:03:01.388 --> 00:03:04.510
Ben Ali, the Barbary Dragon, had no choice.

60
00:03:04.530 --> 00:03:08.354
"Okay, I'll be a farmer," he said.

61
00:03:09.135 --> 00:03:10.836
Dr. Dolittle called the shark.

62
00:03:10.856 --> 00:03:14.640
"Make sure the pirates never leave the island."

63
00:03:14.660 --> 00:03:17.742
"What are those strange sounds you're making?"

64
00:03:18.263 --> 00:03:19.224
Ben Ali asked.

65
00:03:20.552 --> 00:03:21.692
But before Dr.

66
00:03:21.732 --> 00:03:25.073
Dolittle could answer, the sharks took the pirates away.

67
00:03:26.134 --> 00:03:29.574
Dr. Dolittle and the animals watched them swim to the island.

68
00:03:29.594 --> 00:03:34.176
"That's the end of the Barbary Dragon," chuckled Too-Too.

69
00:03:34.196 --> 00:03:39.477
"And the beginning of the Barbary Farmer," laughed Gub-Gub.

70
00:03:39.497 --> 00:03:41.738
"He didn't seem too scary, did he?"

71
00:03:43.718 --> 00:03:45.039
giggled the pushmi-pullyu.

72
00:03:46.959 --> 00:03:49.900
Dr. Dolittle set off again for their journey home.

73
00:03:50.548 --> 00:03:54.470
"Dab-Dab, I hope you learned your lesson," the doctor said.

74
00:03:54.490 --> 00:03:55.931
"Yes, I did.

75
00:03:56.471 --> 00:04:01.174
From now on, I will believe what the rats say," Dab-Dab replied.

76
00:04:02.114 --> 00:04:04.515
Dr. Dolittle was happy to hear that.
